## 🏠 **Real Estate UI Component Rules**

### **Component Reuse Strategy**
- **ALWAYS** reuse existing UI components from `/components/ui/` - these are your primitives
- **ONLY** create new components when existing ones cannot solve the problem
- **ORCHESTRATE** ui components to build complex real estate features

### **Available UI Components** (`/components/ui/`)
#### **Core Components**
- **Button.tsx**: Primary, secondary, outline variants with motion animations
- **Input.tsx**: Form input component with validation support
- **Logo.tsx**: Brand logo component for consistent branding

#### **Real Estate Specific Components**
- **LeadCaptureForm.tsx**: Complete lead capture with validation, GDPR compliance, and analytics
- **LeadCaptureFormClient.tsx**: Client-side version with enhanced interactivity
- **PropertyImage.tsx**: Optimized property image display with Next.js Image
- **FeaturedHomeSlider.tsx**: Property showcase slider with motion animations
- **RealScoutWidget.tsx**: Integrated RealScout property search widget
- **RealScoutAdvancedSearch.tsx**: Advanced property search with filters
- **RealScoutListings.tsx**: Property listings display component
- **PropertySearchWidget.tsx**: Custom property search interface

#### **Community & Market Components**
- **SummerlinWestOverview.tsx**: Community overview and information
- **NeighborhoodHero.tsx**: Hero section for community pages
- **LatestMarketInsights.tsx**: Market data and insights display
- **StatCard.tsx**: Statistics and metrics display cards
- **VistasLeadForm.tsx**: Specialized form for The Vistas community
- **VistasListingForm.tsx**: Property listing form for The Vistas

#### **Content & Layout Components**
- **AboutImage.tsx**: Optimized about section images
- **AgentAvatar.tsx**: Agent profile and avatar display
- **BlogLayout.tsx**: Blog post layout and structure
- **SectionCard.tsx**: Content section wrapper component
- **SEOHead.tsx**: SEO metadata and structured data component
- **TestimonialsSection.tsx**: Customer testimonials display

#### **Integration Components**
- **HomebotWidget.tsx**: Homebot integration for property valuations

### **Design System Compliance**
- **Branding**: Maintain Dr. Janet Duffy's professional real estate branding
- **Colors**: Use established color palette (blues, grays, whites)
- **Typography**: Follow established font hierarchy and sizing
- **Spacing**: Use consistent spacing scale throughout
- **Mobile-First**: Always implement mobile-responsive design

### **SEO & Performance**
- **Image Optimization**: Use Next.js Image component with proper alt text
- **Loading States**: Implement loading states for all dynamic content
- **Error Boundaries**: Include error handling for property data
- **Accessibility**: Ensure WCAG compliance for all components

### **Real Estate Compliance**
- **Fair Housing**: Ensure all components comply with fair housing laws
- **Lead Capture**: Secure and compliant lead capture forms
- **Data Protection**: Protect client information in all components
- **Licensing**: Include proper real estate license information

### **When Components Are Missing**
- **ASK** the human how they want to proceed
- **DOCUMENT** new component requirements
- **CREATE** reusable components that can be used across the site
- **UPDATE** this rule file when new patterns emerge

### **Component Creation Guidelines**
- **TypeScript**: Always use TypeScript with proper interfaces
- **CSS Modules**: Use CSS modules with BEM-style class names
- **Props**: Define clear, typed props for all components
- **Documentation**: Include JSDoc comments for complex components
- **Testing**: Ensure components work across different screen sizes

### **Real Estate Content Integration**
- **Property Data**: Integrate with existing property data structures
- **Market Information**: Use established market data formats
- **Community Data**: Leverage existing community information
- **Contact Information**: Use consistent contact information across components